<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?>
<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0301_man3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ここは　なぜだか
おきゃくさんが　こないなー▼
おっ！　そうだ！
きみ　トレーナーでしょ！▼
がんばって
チャンピオンに　なってよ！▼
ここは　チャンピオンが　きた
へやって　せんでん　しちゃうから！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:35:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:27:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ここは　なぜだか
お客さんが　こないなー▼
おっ！　そうだ！
きみ　トレーナーでしょ！▼
がんばって
チャンピオンに　なってよ！▼
ここは　チャンピオンが　来た
部屋って　宣伝しちゃうから！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:37:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:35:30" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア前
・クリアすると削除し代わりに
　GIRL4、BOY4を配置</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:34:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MAN3</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:26:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0301_girl4_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハネムーンで　ここを　えらぶなんて
さすが　あたしの　えらんだ　ひと！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:32:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハネムーンで　ここを　選ぶなんて
さすが　あたしの　選んだ　人！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:37:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・クリア後に出現
・イベントクリア前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:35:54" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL4
お嬢様（金髪）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:26:00" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0301_girl4_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたは　ステキな　ひと
だれかのために　なにかできる　ひと▼
そのひとが　ならした　かねなら
ここまで　きこえるに　きまってる……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:57:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:42:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたは　ステキな人
だれかのために　なにかできる人▼
その人が　鳴らした　鐘なら
ここまで　きこえるに　決まってる……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:57:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:42:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・クリア後に出現
・イベントクリア後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:35:59" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL4
お嬢様（金髪）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:35:42" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0301_boy4_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>この　へやに　７ばんどうろの
タワーオブヘブンの　かねの　ねいろが▽
とどくと　しあわせに　なれるって！▼
そんな　うわさを　きいてさ
かのじょのために　ならしてほしいな▽
きみ　おねがい　できるかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:39:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:27:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>この部屋に　７番道路の
タワーオブヘブンの　鐘の　音色が▽
届くと　しあわせに　なれるって！▼
そんな　ウワサを　きいてさ
彼女のために　鳴らしてほしいな▽
きみ　お願い　できるかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:38:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:27:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア後に出現
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→
　いいえ→</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:42:55" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY4
お坊ちゃま（金髪）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:25:55" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0301_boy4_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いいね！　きみ！▼
よのなか　きみの　ように
やさしい　ひと　ばかりだと　いいね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:56:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:53:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いいね！　きみ！▼
世の中　きみの　ように
優しい人　ばかりだと　いいね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:56:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:08:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい選択時</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:43:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY4
お坊ちゃま（金髪）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:47:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0301_boy4_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そんなこと　いわずにさ　ぼくたちを
しあわせに　するため　おねがいだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:53:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:49:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そんなこと　いわずにさ　ぼくたちを
しあわせに　するため　お願いだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:38:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:08:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・いいえ選択時</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:43:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY4
お坊ちゃま（金髪）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:47:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0301_boy4_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>７ばんどうろ　から　ここまで
かねの　おとが　きこえるのかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:50:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:50:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>７番道路から　ここまで
鐘の　音が　届くのかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:39:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:08:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい選択後、条件未達成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:46:58" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY4
お坊ちゃま（金髪）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:47:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0301_boy4_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ああ　きみ！　かねの　おとだけど
まだ　きこえないような……▼
……　……　……
……　……　……▼
えっ？　タワーオブヘブンで
かのじょたちが　そんなことを……？▼
まあ　それは　それさ
これは　きみへの　おれいだよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:58:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:56:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ああ　きみ！　鐘の　音だけど
まだ　きこえないような……▼
……　……　……
……　……　……▼
えっ？　タワーオブヘブンで
彼女たちが　そんなことを……？▼
まあ　それは　それさ
これは　きみへの　お礼だよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:58:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:08:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい選択後、条件達成
・アイテム入手処理
　No000「」</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:47:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY4
お坊ちゃま（金髪）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:47:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0301_boy4_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンだったら　６ひきまで
どうじに　つれあるけるのにな……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:48:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:47:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンだったら　６匹まで
同時に　連れ歩けるのにな……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:48:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:48:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アイテム入手後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:47:39" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY4
お坊ちゃま（金髪）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
